SUMMARY:Gateway Open House
LOCATION:2300 Hearst Ave
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an open house at the new Barbara and Gerson Bakar 
 Gateway building on the UC Berkeley campus. Explore our innovative spaces\
 , connect with the campus community\, and experience the new home of the C
 ollege of Computing\, Data Science\, and Society (CDSS). We look forward t
 o welcoming you! Please share this with colleagues and students who may be
  interested to attend.Tuesday\, August 25 2:00 - 4:00 p.m.Barbara and Gers
 on Bakar Gateway 2300 Hearst Ave.\, BerkeleyRegister to attend
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.berkeley.edu/live/events/325131-gateway-open-
 house
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:berkeley:20260903T070000Z-324438@events.berkeley.edu
SEQUENCE:0
